WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:04.165
Homemade BARF for a cat
means a lot of counting.

00:00:04.165 --> 00:00:06.089
barf.flow takes it on.

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:10.153
You start with a few
questions about your cat.

00:00:10.153 --> 00:00:13.334
Weight, body condition, number of meals.

00:00:13.334 --> 00:00:16.998
The app suggests a daily calorie
amount as a starting point.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.220
Pick a ready-made plan or
build your own, step by step.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:28.137
barf.flow calculates the grams and
shows what's missing against NRC norms.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:33.122
The plan becomes a shopping
list for the whole period.

00:00:33.122 --> 00:00:36.704
You know how much to buy and how
to split it all into portions.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:43.617
On the Today screen you tick off feedings,
and barf.flow can remind you about thawing.

00:00:43.617 --> 00:00:47.984
You also log observations and see
weight and appetite on charts.

00:00:49.683 --> 00:00:51.822
You decide what goes in the bowl.
